      <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to <a href="https://hexo.io/" target="_blank">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/" target="_blank">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html" target="_blank">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues" target="_blank">GitHub</a>.</p>
<section><h2>Quick Start<a href="#quick-start"><span>#</span></a></h2><section><h3>Create a new post<a href="#create-a-new-post"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>$</span><span> </span><span>hexo</span><span> </span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>"My New Post"</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html" target="_blank">Writing</a></p></section><section><h3>Run server<a href="#run-server"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>$</span><span> </span><span>hexo</span><span> </span><span>server</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/server.html" target="_blank">Server</a></p></section><section><h3>Generate static files<a href="#generate-static-files"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>$</span><span> </span><span>hexo</span><span> </span><span>generate</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html" target="_blank">Generating</a></p></section><section><h3>Deploy to remote sites<a href="#deploy-to-remote-sites"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>$</span><span> </span><span>hexo</span><span> </span><span>deploy</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html" target="_blank">Deployment</a></p></section></section>]]></content>
